WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.584
He will not
let it go. (man laughs)

00:00:01.584 --> 00:00:02.585
You can tell he is Latin,

00:00:02.585 --> 00:00:04.629
Latin people are tenacious

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:06.089
My name is Nick Barili

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:07.799
and I'm traveling the
country to sit down

00:00:07.799 --> 00:00:09.426
with some of the
biggest Latinx artists

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:10.218
and help tell their stories.

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:11.386
The ugly question is,

00:00:11.386 --> 00:00:12.804
why aren’t Latin
people succeeding?

00:00:13.054 --> 00:00:14.097
When you come from
the neighborhoods that

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:14.973
that we come from,

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:16.433
you need somebody 
outside of you

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:17.642
to tell you that you’re worthy.

00:00:17.642 --> 00:00:18.768
I'm sure there's
somebody watching

00:00:18.768 --> 00:00:21.396
who is probably in those shoes
when you were at that time,

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:23.273
figuring how am I gonna
make it out of this job,

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:24.190
to start my career?

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:29.029
I feel like if you've achieved
a certain amount of success,

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.363
you gotta give back.

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:32.115
You can’t pretend 
it's not happening.

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:33.616
Why do you think not
as many people

00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:35.577
are as vocal as you
are about this subject?

00:00:35.577 --> 00:00:37.787
- Well, being vocal has its cost.

00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:40.081
when I became very
politically conscious

00:00:40.081 --> 00:00:41.166
I got a lot of hate.

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:42.208
"Go back to your country,"

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:43.668
"Go back to Mexico,"

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:46.713
which I'm not Mexican, but
I'll gladly go back to Mexico.

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:47.964
Cause it's a great country.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:51.009
Hearing from one generation
to the next generation

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:52.594
I don't want you to go
through what I went through.

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:55.055
-No. I don't want any kid to go
through what I went through.

00:00:55.096 --> 00:00:57.182
-How do you maneuver
through the industry?

00:00:57.182 --> 00:00:59.184
I got scars on my head from
 hitting that glass ceiling.

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:00.393
(in Spanish)
To culture.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:01.227
- Much love, much love.

